      "reason": "'世話' (sewa) is a more appropriate general translation for 'care' (noun) in the context of 'looking after', 'attending to', or 'provision of needs' (e.g., child care, elderly care, pet care). It covers a much broader and more common range of daily life meanings for 'care' than '治療', making it more natural for a general language learner."
